<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100783" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοικ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοίκησις, δέξομαι Παλλάδος
					ξυνοικίαν</span>
			 will accept her offer of <i>living with her</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				916
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a body of people living together, settlement, community</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				267
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύτῃ τῇ συνοικίᾳ ἐθέμεθα πόλιν
					ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					369c
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				679b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλοι, βοηθοί, μάρτυρες, συνοικίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					65.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψευδήων ἂν τὰν συϝοικίαν τοῖς
					Ἐρχομινίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(2).343.39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i> (Orchom. <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>house in which several families live, tenement-house</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				273
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				1.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				5.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				36.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				45.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				326.21
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Teos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπου πολλοὶ μισθωσάμενοι μίαν οἴκησιν
					διελόμενοι ἔχουσι, συνοικίαν καλοῦμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.124
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἓν στόμ᾽ ἐστὶ τῆς συνοικίης πάσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					3.47
				</span></i>
			; <i>lodging-house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				3p.186
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1573.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>store-room</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1001
			</span></i> (cf. Sch. ad loc.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> perh. <i>village, hamlet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.11.1
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.280e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
